factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the medical camp was 'இலவச' (free), but the article does not mention that the camp was free.
  The reel_script says the medical camp was held at Thangasalai area as a separate event; the article says the camp was at Thangasalai area too, so this is fine, but the slides_spec line 'சேலம், நாமக்கல், தருமபுரி, கிருஷ்ணகிரி, ஈரோடு மாவட்டங்களை' is an incomplete sentence with no clear meaning in Tamil.
  The slides_spec line 'பொதுச்செயலாளர் கலைவாணன் ஏற்பாடு செய்தார்' and 'துணை செயலாளர் கீர்த்தனா பிரபு பங்கேற்றார்' say she 'participated', while the article only says she arranged the event with others, so 'பங்கேற்றார்' is an unsupported detail.
  The caption says the office was opened and the camp held at 'அதே இடத்தில்' (same place), which is an inferred detail not clearly stated in the article.
  The reel_script omits the important fact that the Salem regional union (the association) operates from Vennandur in Namakkal district, and omits the list of ஏற்பாடு organizers' roles such as Erode district president Sathya Premkumar and office in-charge Prabu (partially covered, but incomplete).
